    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/c8a30c7b79489e206097a546ba4fb5bb.avif?t=1663309441\" /></div><br>There are 4 classes that you can choose from. Warrior, Magician, Assassin, Ranger each have their own unique play-style.<br><br>There are many skills such as Mining, Fishing, and Woodcutting that you can advance to unlock higher tier gear and loot<br>Kill monsters to grind Experience and unlock Levels to assign Stat Points to further progress your character! Take on Dungeons<br>and Bosses solo or in a group to craft unique and interesting items!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/852d0942d7d432bb817a96617d930efb.avif?t=1663309441\" /></div><br>Character Progression<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/d1ca25e0a7bbb2ba46c95442ccf512a0.avif?t=1663309441\" /></div><br>Loot/Items<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/383b05c01a04fb6aeb638b2b51aee018.avif?t=1663309441\" /></div><br>Combat<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/a224fd59984d66dab6cd3e157ae829bd.poster.avif?t=1663309441\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/a224fd59984d66dab6cd3e157ae829bd.webm?t=1663309441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2135350/extras/a224fd59984d66dab6cd3e157ae829bd.mp4?t=1663309441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Mounts<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" a